<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="csrf-token" content="{{ csrf_token() }}"><title>Crea-Biz EV</title>
<script src="/theme.js"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/platform.css"></head>
<body><a class="skip-link" href="#workspace">Skip to content / انتقل للمحتوى</a><header><a href="#workspace" class="brand"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">ϟ</span><strong>Crea-Biz<span>EV NETWORK</span></strong></a><label class="theme-control"><span data-en="Appearance" data-ar="المظهر">Appearance</span><select id="theme-choice" aria-label="Appearance / المظهر"><option value="system">System / النظام</option><option value="light">Light / فاتح</option><option value="dark">Dark / داكن</option></select></label><button id="language">العربية</button></header><nav class="workspace-nav" aria-label="Workspace / مساحة العمل"><p class="nav-caption">WORKSPACE / مساحة العمل</p><a href="#discover">↗ <span data-en="Discover stations" data-ar="اكتشف المحطات">Discover stations</span></a><a href="#identity">◉ <span data-en="Account" data-ar="الحساب">Account</span></a><a href="#bookings" data-access="auth" hidden>▤ Reservations / الحجوزات</a><a href="#simulations" data-access="auth" hidden>ϟ Sessions / الجلسات</a><a href="#garage" data-access="auth" hidden>◇ My garage / مركباتي</a><a href="#fleets" data-access="auth" hidden>▦ Fleet / الأسطول</a><a href="#vendor" data-access="vendor" hidden>⌁ Stations / المحطات</a><a href="#admin" data-access="admin" hidden>▥ Operations / العمليات</a><a href="#support" data-access="auth" hidden>◎ Support / الدعم</a><a href="#regions">◎ Regions / المناطق</a><p class="nav-footnote">Development workspace<br>Simulator inventory only</p></nav><main id="workspace" tabindex="-1"><p id="offline-banner" class="connection-banner" role="status" hidden>You are offline. Account actions need a connection. / أنت غير متصل</p><div class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow" id="workspace-label">Your charging companion</p>
<h1 data-en="Find your next charge" data-ar="ابحث عن محطة الشحن التالية">Find your next charge</h1>
<p data-en="Station discovery and development reservations. Physical charging and payments are not connected." data-ar="اكتشاف المحطات وحجوزات التطوير. الشحن الفعلي والمدفوعات غير متصلة.">Station discovery and development reservations. Physical charging and payments are not connected.</p>
</div><div class="hero-emblem" aria-hidden="true"><span>ϟ</span><small>CHARGE · CONNECT · GO</small></div></div><p id="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
<section id="identity"><h2>Account / الحساب</h2><form id="account"><label>Name / الاسم<input name="name" autocomplete="name"></label><label>Email / البريد<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></label><label>Password / كلمة المرور<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" minlength="12" required></label><button name="mode" value="login">Sign in / دخول</button><button name="mode" value="register">Register / تسجيل</button></form><form id="forgot-password"><label>Recovery email<input type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email"></label><button>Send reset link</button></form><div id="signed" hidden><span id="who"></span><p id="email-status" role="status"></p><button id="verify-email" type="button" hidden data-en="Send verification email" data-ar="إرسال رسالة التحقق">Send verification email</button><button id="refresh-identity" type="button" data-en="Refresh account status" data-ar="تحديث حالة الحساب">Refresh account status</button> <button id="logout">Sign out / خروج</button></div></section>
<section id="discover"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE / استكشف</p><h2 data-en="Find a place to recharge" data-ar="ابحث عن مكان للشحن">Find a place to recharge</h2></div><button id="refresh-catalog" type="button" class="secondary">Refresh / تحديث</button></div><form id="filters"><label>Station name<input name="q" maxlength="100"></label><label>Connector / الموصل<select name="connector_type"><option value="">All / الكل</option><option>CCS2</option><option>Type2</option><option>CHAdeMO</option></select></label><label>Country / الدولة<input name="country" maxlength="2" pattern="[A-Z]{2}" placeholder="AE"></label><label>Minimum kW<input name="min_power_kw" type="number" min="1" max="1000"></label><button>Search / بحث</button></form><p id="catalog-state" class="muted" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="stations" class="station-grid"></div><nav id="catalog-pagination" class="pagination" aria-label="Station pages / صفحات المحطات"></nav></section>
<section id="bookings" hidden><h2>Reservations / الحجوزات</h2><p>Each development reservation covers one 30-minute UTC slot on the station's single test connector.</p><div id="reservation-list"></div></section>
<section id="vendor" hidden><h2>Vendor station registration / تسجيل محطة</h2><form id="station-form"><label>Name<input name="name" required></label><label>Country<input name="country" value="AE" maxlength="2" required></label><label>Currency<input name="currency" value="AED" maxlength="3" required></label><label>Timezone<input name="timezone" value="Asia/Dubai" required></label><label>Latitude<input name="latitude" type="number" step="any" min="-90" max="90" required></label><label>Longitude<input name="longitude" type="number" step="any" min="-180" max="180" required></label><label>Connector<select name="connector_type"><option>CCS2</option><option>Type2</option><option>CHAdeMO</option></select></label><label>kW<input name="power_kw" type="number" min="1" max="1000" required></label><label>Source<select name="source"><option value="discovery">Discovery only</option><option value="simulator">Simulator inventory</option></select></label><button>Create station</button></form></section>
<section id="simulations" hidden><h2>Simulated charging / الشحن التجريبي</h2><div id="simulation-list"></div></section><section id="admin" hidden><h2>Admin operational overview</h2><div id="overview"></div></section><section id="fleets" hidden><h2>Fleet accounts / حسابات الأسطول</h2><form id="fleet-create"><label>Fleet name<input name="name" required maxlength="150"></label><label>Country<input name="country" value="AE" required maxlength="2"></label><button>Create fleet</button></form><div id="fleet-list"></div><h3>Invitations</h3><div id="fleet-invitations"></div><div id="fleet-detail"></div></section><section id="regions"><h2>Regional configuration</h2><div id="region-list"></div><form id="region-config" hidden><label>Country<input name="country" required maxlength="2"></label><label>Currency<input name="currency" required maxlength="3"></label><label>Minor unit digits<input name="minor_units" type="number" min="0" max="3" required></label><label>Time zone<input name="timezone" required></label><label>Tax basis points (configuration only)<input name="tax_bps" type="number" min="0" max="10000"></label><button>Save region (commerce remains disabled)</button></form></section><section id="garage" hidden><h2>My vehicles / مركباتي</h2><form id="vehicle-create"><label>Vehicle name<input name="name" required maxlength="100"></label><label>Connector<select name="connector_type"><option>CCS2</option><option>Type2</option><option>CHAdeMO</option></select></label><button>Add vehicle</button></form><div id="vehicle-list"></div><h3>Profile / الملف الشخصي</h3><form id="profile-form"><label>Display name<input name="name" required maxlength="100"></label><label>Language<select name="locale"><option value="en">English</option><option value="ar">العربية</option></select></label><button>Save profile</button></form></section><section id="support" hidden><h2>Support / الدعم</h2><form id="support-create"><label>Subject<input name="subject" maxlength="150" required></label><label>Message<textarea name="body" maxlength="5000" required></textarea></label><button>Open ticket</button></form><div id="ticket-list"></div><div id="ticket-detail"></div><h3>Notifications / الإشعارات</h3><div id="notifications"></div></section></main><script src="/client.js" defer></script><script src="/platform.js" defer></script></body></html>